# App implementation conventions

## Layers

```
components → DataRoomRepository → MemoryRepository | IdbRepository
domain/* = pure functions (no React, no IDB)
```

## Do

- Granular components per `docs/research/07b-impl-kb-components.md`
- Toast on auto-rename; confirm cascade delete with N
- `revokeObjectURL` when closing PDF preview
- PDF: `accept` + validate; max 20MB

## Don't

- Import `idb` from UI components
- Add Auth, Share, Permissions, content search, non-PDF types
- Ship kebab/menu items that no-op
- Install dnd-kit before Move dialog works

## Persistence

Bootstrap: try Idb → on failure Memory + degraded banner (ADR-09).
